    {
      "post_id": "2089097617884283026",
      "url": "https://x.com/colindougherty/status/2089097617884283026",
      "text": "\"Brands are losing 3-10% of their top-line revenue to counterfeiters, dupes, and unauthorized resellers.\"\n\n @oliverbrocato, Founder of Bustem, says \"Even David Protein has 12 one-to-one clones of their website.\"\n\n\"When you start making money online, people bite at your heels to take a piece.\" \n\n\"It's worse in ecommerce because there are basically zero barriers to entry. Anyone can screenshot your product image and rip you off.\" \n\nIt shows up in a dozen ways:\n\n- Counterfeit one-to-one dupes from Temu, Alibaba, etc.\n\n- Unauthorized resellers on Amazon, eBay, Walmart. Sometimes selling right on your own ASIN, so the customer thinks they're buying from you.\n\n- Full clones of your website.\n\n- Keyword ad hijacking. Bad actors run ads on the real brand's name and rank #1-5, siphoning off traffic that should've been yours.\n\n- Ripped Meta ads run against you. Since Meta is an auction, that drives your own CPMs up.\n\nThe Bustem fix is a blend of software, scrapers, AI agents, and automation.\n\nBacked by a team of human analysts who hunt down the bad actors and get them removed.\n\nAll without hiring a lawyer and spending six figures and three years in court.\n\n@ecommcowboy is live M-F at 12P CT.",
      "original_text": "\"Brands are losing 3-10% of their top-line revenue to counterfeiters, dupes, and unauthorized resellers.\"\n\n @oliverbrocato, Founder of Bustem, says \"Even David Protein has 12 one-to-one clones of their website.\"\n\n\"When you start making money online, people bite at your heels to take a piece.\" \n\n\"It's worse in ecommerce because there are basically zero barriers to entry. Anyone can screenshot your product image and rip you off.\" \n\nIt shows up in a dozen ways:\n\n- Counterfeit one-to-one dupes from Temu, Alibaba, etc.\n\n- Unauthorized resellers on Amazon, eBay, Walmart. Sometimes selling right on your own ASIN, so the customer thinks they're buying from you.\n\n- Full clones of your website.\n\n- Keyword ad hijacking. Bad actors run ads on the real brand's name and rank #1-5, siphoning off traffic that should've been yours.\n\n- Ripped Meta ads run against you. Since Meta is an auction, that drives your own CPMs up.\n\nThe Bustem fix is a blend of software, scrapers, AI agents, and automation.\n\nBacked by a team of human analysts who hunt down the bad actors and get them removed.\n\nAll without hiring a lawyer and spending six figures and three years in court.\n\n@ecommcowboy is live M-F at 12P CT.",
      "links": [],
      "translation_zh": "“品牌正因造假者、仿品和未经授权的转售商损失其总收入的 3-10%。”\n\n Bustem 创始人 @oliverbrocato 表示：“甚至 David Protein 的网站都有 12 个一比一克隆版。”\n\n“当你开始在网上赚钱时，就会有人紧咬着你，想分一杯羹。”\n\n“在电商领域情况更糟，因为基本上没有进入门槛。任何人都可以截取你的产品图片，然后抄袭你。”\n\n它会以十几种方式出现：\n\n- 来自 Temu、Alibaba 等的一比一假冒仿品。\n\n- Amazon、eBay、Walmart 上未经授权的转售商。有时甚至直接在你自己的 ASIN 上销售，让顾客以为他们是在向你购买。\n\n- 你网站的完整克隆版。\n\n- 关键词广告劫持。不良行为者用真实品牌的名称投放广告，并排在第 1-5 位， siphon 走本该属于你的流量。\n\n- 被盗用的 Meta 广告反过来与你竞争。由于 Meta 是拍卖机制，这会推高你自己的 CPM。\n\nBustem 的解决方案是软件、爬虫、AI 代理和自动化的组合。\n\n并由一支人工分析师团队支持，他们会追查不良行为者并将其移除。\n\n这一切都无需聘请律师，也无需花六位数金额和三年时间打官司。\n\n@ecommcowboy 周一至周五 CT 时间 12P 直播。",
      "translation_status": "translated",
